OL,3,GNEWSAM1 closed in both directions after
OL,4,Alorry overturns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of the M1 in Leicestershire
OL,7,Fhas been closed in both directions
OL,8,Fafter a lorry overturned.
OL,10,FAt about 05:30 BST on Wednesday,
OL,11,FNational Highways said the motorway was
OL,12,Fshut between junction 24 at Kegworth
OL,13,Fand junction 23A for East Midlands
OL,14,FAirport.
OL,16,FIt added that a lorry had overturned
OL,17,Fand "come to rest on the central
OL,18,Freservation barrier".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
